   "options": "<div class=\"llm-model-hero\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Model setup\"><span class=\"llm-hero-badge\">Desk assistant</span><div class=\"llm-model-hero-title\">Connect a model</div><p class=\"llm-model-hero-text\">Choose an <strong>LLM Provider</strong> (base URL, API key, custom headers), then set the vendor <strong>Model ID</strong>. On the provider, use <strong>Tools → Import from cURL</strong> to paste a working request.</p><ol class=\"llm-hero-steps\" role=\"list\"><li><span class=\"llm-hero-step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span>Create or pick a provider with the right base URL.</span></li><li><span class=\"llm-hero-step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span>Map headers and API key; save the provider.</span></li><li><span class=\"llm-hero-step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span>Enter the model id here and enable the row.</span></li></ol></div>"
